    <detaileddescription>
<para>The serial port receiver connects to a device and feeds the QgsNmeaConnection over QSerialPort. It receives QgsGpsInformation and converts it to <ref refid="classQfGnssPositionInformation" kindref="compound">QfGnssPositionInformation</ref> </para>
